<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ICA raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ICA raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it had upgraded Mexico's Empresas ICA Sociedad Controladora SA de CV to a buy from a hold.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Gordon Lee made the recommendation in a Jan 15 report.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts were unchanged at 15-3/4 in New York.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
